Package: SpaColExt
Type: Package
Title: Infer Spatial Colonization and Extinction Dates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Clara", "Casabona i Amat",
           email = "Clara.Casabona.I.Amat@USherbrooke.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Simon", "Bouchard", role = "aut")
    )
Author: Clara Casabona i Amat [aut, cre],
    Simon Bouchard [aut]
Maintainer: Clara Casabona i Amat <Clara.Casabona.I.Amat@USherbrooke.ca>
Description: Infers spatial colonization and extinction dates from
    species sighting records. The package implements Bayesian estimators
    based on Solow (1993) and related extensions to estimate the posterior
    probability that a species remains extant over time and across spatial
    units.
